# A page that names a check a called workflow reports

Two of the contexts this repository requires are reported by a job that hands its
work to a workflow declared in another repository, so the name a run reports
under is composed of the job here and the job there.

The `call / build` check and the `call / test` check are both of that shape, and
a reader that knew only about job names declared here would refuse this page for
naming them correctly.
